( -updated_linear neglects rigid body rotations, audit cluster K01.
  Simple shear of one quad4 (sfnet druckpr1), gamma = 1 in one step,
  Drucker-Prager phi = 0, c = 0.1: the shear stress is capped at
  0.11547 and the normal stresses stay 0.
  Manual Professional 2.2.1: -updated_linear adds the extra stresses to
  the previous stresses with NO rotation by R. The pre-fix GNU rotated
  the stress by the incremental rotation (atan(gamma/2) = 26.57 deg):
  sigxx 0.0924, sigxy 0.0693, sigyy -0.0924.
  Pro 02-08-2026: sigxx 0, sigxy 0.11547, sigyy 0. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_strain_total
materi_strain_plasti
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1  0  0
node 2  1  0
node 3  0  1
node 4  1  1
element 1  -quad4 1 2 3 4
bounda_dof 0  -ra 1 2 -ra -velx -vely
bounda_time 0  0. 0. 100. 0.
bounda_dof 1  -ra 3 4 -ra -vely
bounda_time 1  0. 0. 100. 0.
bounda_dof 2  -ra 3 4 -ra -velx
bounda_time 2  0. 1. 100. 1.
group_type 0  -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0  1.
group_materi_memory 0  -updated_linear
group_materi_plasti_druck_prag 0  0. 0.1 0.
control_timestep 0  1. 1.
target_item 0  -node_dof 1 -sigxy
target_value 0  0.11547 1.e-5
target_item 1  -node_dof 1 -sigxx
target_value 1  0. 1.e-6
target_item 2  -node_dof 4 -sigyy
target_value 2  0. 1.e-6
end_data
